*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% brother-pwg-macos -- PPD template
*%
*% Copyright (C) 2026  brother-pwg-macos contributors
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
*%
*% This is a superset. ppd/generate-ppd.sh substitutes the at-sign delimited
*% placeholders and strips the page sizes and quality levels a given model does
*% not have, using the capability row from ppd/models.tsv. A leftover
*% placeholder is a bug and test/test_ppd.sh fails on one.
*%
*% Page geometry is Brother's own, from the inf/PaperDimension and
*% inf/ImagingArea tables in their GPL Linux driver (dcpt220pdrv 3.5.0-1).
*% 8.5 pt is 3.00 mm.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "BRPWG.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*Product: "(@MODEL@)"
*ModelName: "Brother @MODEL@"
*ShortNickName: "Brother @MODEL@"
*NickName: "@NICKNAME@"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Brother;MDL:@MODEL@;CMD:HBP,PJL;"

*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "image/pwg-raster 0 @FILTER@"

*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "12"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*VariablePaperSize: False

*% CUPS requires this keyword to exist. The real resolution for a job comes
*% from the *BRQuality choice below, which is the only control that sets it.
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi

*% ==== Print quality =====================================================
*%
*% Quality and raster resolution are deliberately ONE control. On this
*% hardware they are coupled: 600 dpi raster sent at PRINTQUALITY=NORMAL
*% prints coarser than the raster it was given, so exposing them separately
*% only lets users pair them wrongly and conclude the driver is broken.
*%
*% Measured on a DCP-T220: at NORMAL the 600 dpi line-pair target collapses
*% into about five coarse aliased bands; at HIGH the same target resolves
*% into many separate fine lines. Flat mid-tones and solid blacks are also
*% visibly smoother at HIGH.
*%
*% Photo (1200 dpi) did not resolve in either axis on the DCP-T220 and costs
*% roughly four times the data over USB 2.0. It is offered, not recommended.
*%
*OpenUI *BRQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BRQuality
*DefaultBRQuality: @DEFAULT_QUALITY@
*BRQuality Draft/Draft - 300 dpi, fastest: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*BRQuality Normal/Normal - 600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*BRQuality Best/Best - 600 dpi, fine detail: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*BRQuality Photo/Photo - 1200 dpi: "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *BRQuality

*% ==== Colour mode =======================================================
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 19/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% ==== Media type ========================================================
*OpenUI *BRMediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *BRMediaType
*DefaultBRMediaType: Plain
*BRMediaType Plain/Plain Paper: ""
*BRMediaType Inkjet/Inkjet Paper: ""
*BRMediaType Glossy/Glossy Paper: ""
*CloseUI: *BRMediaType

*% ==== Media size ========================================================
*%
*% Every entry uses "ImagingBBox null", which is what makes CUPS rasterise the
*% full sheet. The printer expects a full-sheet raster and applies its own
*% unprintable border; verified on a DCP-T220, where a full-sheet raster with
*% all JT margins at 0 lost under 1 mm on every edge.
*%
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: @DEFAULT_PAGESIZE@
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4.Fullbleed/A4 (Borderless): "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter (Borderless): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6.Fullbleed/A6 (Borderless): "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x6/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x6.Fullbleed/4 x 6 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 5x7/5 x 7 in: "<</PageSize[359 505]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 5x7.Fullbleed/5 x 7 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[359 505]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 5x8/5 x 8 in: "<</PageSize[360 576]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 5x8.Fullbleed/5 x 8 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[360 576]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 3.5x5/3.5 x 5 in: "<</PageSize[252 360]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 3.5x5.Fullbleed/3.5 x 5 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[252 360]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Envelope Com-10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: @DEFAULT_PAGESIZE@
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4.Fullbleed/A4 (Borderless): "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter (Borderless): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6.Fullbleed/A6 (Borderless): "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 4x6/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 4x6.Fullbleed/4 x 6 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 5x7/5 x 7 in: "<</PageSize[359 505]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 5x7.Fullbleed/5 x 7 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[359 505]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 5x8/5 x 8 in: "<</PageSize[360 576]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 5x8.Fullbleed/5 x 8 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[360 576]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 3.5x5/3.5 x 5 in: "<</PageSize[252 360]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 3.5x5.Fullbleed/3.5 x 5 in (Borderless): "<</PageSize[252 360]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/Envelope Com-10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: @DEFAULT_PAGESIZE@
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "8.5 8.5 586.5 833.5"
*ImageableArea A4.Fullbleed/A4 (Borderless): "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "8.5 8.5 603.5 783.5"
*ImageableArea Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter (Borderless): "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "8.5 8.5 603.5 999.5"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "8.5 8.5 411.5 586.5"
*ImageableArea A6/A6: "8.5 8.5 288.5 411.5"
*ImageableArea A6.Fullbleed/A6 (Borderless): "0 0 297 420"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "8.5 8.5 513.5 747.5"
*ImageableArea 4x6/4 x 6 in: "8.5 8.5 279.5 423.5"
*ImageableArea 4x6.Fullbleed/4 x 6 in (Borderless): "0 0 288 432"
*ImageableArea 5x7/5 x 7 in: "8.5 8.5 350.5 496.5"
*ImageableArea 5x7.Fullbleed/5 x 7 in (Borderless): "0 0 359 505"
*ImageableArea 5x8/5 x 8 in: "8.5 8.5 351.5 567.5"
*ImageableArea 5x8.Fullbleed/5 x 8 in (Borderless): "0 0 360 576"
*ImageableArea 3.5x5/3.5 x 5 in: "8.5 8.5 243.5 351.5"
*ImageableArea 3.5x5.Fullbleed/3.5 x 5 in (Borderless): "0 0 252 360"
*ImageableArea Env10/Envelope Com-10: "8.5 34 288.5 650"
*ImageableArea EnvDL/Envelope DL: "8.5 34 303.5 590"
*ImageableArea EnvC5/Envelope C5: "8.5 34 450.5 615"
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "8.5 34 270.5 506"

*DefaultPaperDimension: @DEFAULT_PAGESIZE@
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A4.Fullbleed/A4 (Borderless): "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter (Borderless): "612 792"
